\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces SoundCode's producer-consumer architecture. The producer LM streams tokens; a structural boundary detector identifies depth-zero \texttt  {;} and \texttt  {\}} in the function body; at each boundary an async verifier task is spawned on a snapshot of the current buffer; a consumer drains finished verifier tasks in FIFO order; on the first blocking diagnostic, pending tasks are cancelled and the buffer is rolled back to the most recent boundary checkpoint.}}{7}{figure.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:arch}{{4}{7}{SoundCode's producer-consumer architecture. The producer LM streams tokens; a structural boundary detector identifies depth-zero \code {;} and \code {\}} in the function body; at each boundary an async verifier task is spawned on a snapshot of the current buffer; a consumer drains finished verifier tasks in FIFO order; on the first blocking diagnostic, pending tasks are cancelled and the buffer is rolled back to the most recent boundary checkpoint}{figure.4}{}}
